    "description": "Microsoft India South Asia Partners is actively seeking a talented and motivated Backend Developer to join our dynamic team in Gwalior. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Microsoft India South Asia Partners:\nMicrosoft India South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Participate in code reviews and contribute to technical discussions\n• Implement new features based on product requirements\n• Participate in on-call rotation for production support\n• Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve software defects and performance issues\n• Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code\n• Design, develop and maintain scalable software applications\n• Ensure code security and follow best practices for data protection\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in React\n• Proficiency in Python\n• Proficiency in CI/CD\n• Proficiency in JavaScript\n• Proficiency in Kubernetes\n• Proficiency in Docker\n• Proficiency in Agile/Scrum\n• Proficiency in TensorFlow\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Microsoft India South Asia Partners!",
